> model m { iadd: 1, fadd: 1, fmul: 2, fuse ff(a: float, b: float, c: float) = a*b + c : fmul }
> model n : m { fdiv: 3 }
> cost x*y + z model n
cost of x*y + z under n: 2 (2 operations, shared subterms counted once)
  fused by the model (one instruction for several operations):
    ff               1 x 2     = 2  (a*b + c; saves 1)
